        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperb site extending to approx. 0.53ha (1.3acres) Folio No. WX51466F suitable for a detached home. While local needs will apply the property offers excellent potential being within easy access of Murrintown Village and vibrant Wexford town. \n\nThe property is just 3.5km from Murrintown Village and 8.5km from Wexford town. This site is being sold subject to planning for one house only.\n\nFull maps etc available from SF Radford\n\nDIRECTIONS:\nFrom Wexford town leave the Whitford House Hotel roundabout and proceed on the R733 (Newline Road) for 5Km and site is on the RHS (just before property with Eircode Y35X3V1)"
